        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 930AR, Square 930 Lever with Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Lever with Arched Rose from the <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Collection</b></a>  is a timeless mixture of modern and traditional shapes. The square lever is modern but the arched rose gives it a softer feel, making it a great compliment to contemporary homes. Choose from 7 finishes including satin brass, polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. The 930 Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets that are 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Timeless Square Lever with Steeped Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>28° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 930AR Square Leverset with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Door Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Lever with Arched Rose, Omnia 930AR",
                "description": "Omnia 930AR, Square Lever with Arched Rose - The Square Lever with Arched Rose is a timeless mixture of modern and traditional shapes. The square lever is modern but the arched rose gives it a softer feel, making it a great compliment to contemporary homes. Choose from 7 finishes including polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. The 930 Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick.",
                "keywords": "Square Lever with Arched Roses, Omnia 930AR Square Leverset with Arched Rosette, OMN-930AR, Square Lever with Arched Rosettes, privacy levers, passage levers, solid brass levers, omnia prodigy collections, Square 930 Lever with Arched Roses, Timeless Square Lever with Steeped Arched Roses, Omnia 930AR Square Leverset with Arched Roses,"
